# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw recommender dataset (Kaggle "Event Recommendation Engine Challenge")
#
# ~1.5 GB of CSVs (and a ~170 MB zip of the same). The Biased MF recommender only
# needs event_interest.csv, which is committed under backend/src/main/resources/
# dataset/ (647 KB) and packaged into the jar. The raw download is NOT committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/dataset/
/dataset.zip

# Trained recommender model artifacts (regenerated on startup / nightly cron)
/data/
/backend/data/

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/backend/target/
/frontend/dist/
/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/.angular/
*.class

# ── Local uploads ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/backend/uploads/
/uploads/

# ── Secrets / local config ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit credentials, keystores, or local environment overrides.
.env
.env.*
*.p12
*.jks
application-local.yml
application-local.properties

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── IDE / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

